{"dispatcherNoops":[],"extraCodes":[{"id":1236,"values":[760,762,0,0,0]},{"id":1237,"values":[48,1,0,830,0]},{"id":1508,"values":[29,1,0,1026,0]},{"id":1509,"values":[1107,1109,0,0,0]},{"id":1510,"values":[2,0,0,1027,0]},{"id":1824,"values":[64,1,0,1196,0]}],"fixtureNote":"Selected unmodified semantic records from the Providence War in the Sword Lands export.","messages":[{"authored":false,"id":1107,"text":"You overhear a conversation: \"I can't believe that Wailsrond has fallen!\" A merchant exclaims. \"Aye!\" Another one adds. \"I fear trade will suffer very much, and we will live through hard economic times.\""},{"authored":false,"id":1108,"text":"You overhear a conversation: \"Did you hear? Wailsrond has fallen!\" A woman exclaims. \"Aye!\" Another one adds. \"I fear that Sharranth cannot be stopped, and soon the Warlord will attack us as well!\""},{"authored":false,"id":1109,"text":"You overhear a conversation: \"Me cain't believe that Wailsrond has fallen!\" A sailor exclaims. \"Oy!\" A miner adds. \"An' ye cain be sure that Sharranth will come fer us next! These be dark times acomin', friend, even darker than six moons past.\""},{"authored":false,"id":1110,"text":"\"Were are the Heroes of the Sword Lands? Why aren't they doing anything to stop this?\""},{"authored":false,"id":1246,"text":"\"Bah!\" Someone else replies. \"Don't count on them! I heard that they got a better offer from the Warlord of Sharranth, and took it!\" A woman shakes her head, sadly: \"Then we may be doomed ...\""}],"optionLabels":[],"randomLevels":[],"schemaVersion":4,"triggers":[{"actions":[{"category":"branch","code":46,"gosub":false,"id":1237,"kind":"classic","label":"Branch quest flag","rawCode":46,"slot":0},{"category":"ui_text","code":9,"gosub":false,"id":208,"kind":"classic","label":"Play sound","rawCode":9,"slot":1},{"category":"ui_text","code":19,"gosub":false,"id":1236,"kind":"classic","label":"Display random string","rawCode":19,"slot":2},{"category":"branch","code":46,"gosub"